81_85228034.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/destinychild/1609491221281_85228034.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"text-align:center;width:60px;height:60px;vertical-align:middle;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0px;\"><img data-v-34546da4=\"\" alt=\"\" data-src=\"https://cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1640535901191_72866112.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" src=\"//cdnimg-v2.gamekee.com/images/www/1640535901191_72866112.png?x-image-process=image/resize,m_lfit,h_300,w_300\" lazy=\"loaded\" data-width=\"128\" data-height=\"128\" style=\"text-align:center;width:60px;height:60px;vertical-align:middle;color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:0px;\"><br></span></div><div class=\"se-text-paragraph se-text-paragraph-align- \" style=\"text-align: left; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-size: 0px;\"><span class=\"se-fs-fs13 se-ff-system  se-style-unset \" style=\"font-size:13px;color:rgb(56,118,29);font-style:normal!important;\"><br></span></div></div></span></div></div></b></div></div></div></div><div class=\"div-img\"><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">活动理解</span></div></div><br></div><div></div><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><div>1. 双重乱斗属于DC的高福利活动，请各位重视，只要不是刚刚入坑的都可以有比较好的奖励可以拿。</div><div>2. 并不是非要15个高练度的角色才能玩，<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">只要你有一套五人的PVP队伍</span>前11场都很容易，只有12胜的那一场有点难度。<span style=\"color:rgb(0,0,0);font-size:13.9999px;\">我们的目标是：资源投入第一排，第二批第三排随便赛点人进去。95%的玩家都没有15套装备、魂卡、附魔。</span></div></span><div></div><div><br></div><div><div contenteditable=\"false\" class=\"title-model-wrapper title1\"><div contenteditable=\"true\" class=\"title-p\"><span style=\"line-height: 2;\"><span style=\"font-size: 20px;\">配队</span></span></div></div><br></div><div><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">理想中的队伍Buff组合：